</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Sent:</span><span>&nbsp;Tuesday, July 21, 2026 05:28 PM</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">To:</span><span>&nbsp;wonsuk.choi@kt.com &lt;wonsuk.choi@kt.com&gt;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Cc:</span><span>&nbsp;Keehoon Kim (Kenneth) &lt;Kenneth.Kim@microsoft.com&gt;; Jay Park &lt;parkjay@microsoft.com&gt;; Yongha Hwang &lt;yonghahwang@microsoft.com&gt;; hyukjun.nam &lt;hyukjun.nam@kt.com&gt;; ps.hee@kt.com &lt;ps.hee@kt.com&gt;; jh.jung@kt.com &lt;jh.jung@kt.com&gt;; kisungg.kim@kt.com &lt;kisungg.kim@kt.com&gt;; Jacob Baek &lt;jacobbaek@microsoft.com&gt;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Subject:</span><span>&nbsp;Kubernetes Gateway API - TrackingID#2607210030004076</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px\"><br></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">안녕하세요.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">마이크로소프트 Azure 기술지원에 문의해 주셔서 감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">본 케이스를 지원하게 된 마이크로소프트 AKS 기술지원팀 백도운 입니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&#47676;저, 유선&#51004;로 통화가 필요할 경우가 존재하여 아래와 사항을 사전에 안내 드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">한국마이크로소프트는 산업안전보건법에 따른 고객 응대근로자 보호조치를 따르고 있습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">엔지니어가 고객께 전화를 드릴 때 수신번호 1577-9700 &#51004;로 표시되며,</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">상담 내용은 고객지원 및 서비스 개선 등을 위해 녹음 되며, 관련 법안에 따라 일정기간 보관됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">문의사항을 다음과 같이 정리하여 전달드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">내용을 살펴보시고 문의사항 있&#51004;시면 언제든지 연락 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">[문의 사항]</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">대상: /subscriptions/6ccc8d33-f6cb-48dc-95e1-33ad9eb4de8d/resourceGroups/rg-az01-og057901-dev-ris-01/providers/Microsoft.ContainerService/managedClusters/aks-az01-dev-ris-01</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">문의사항:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">App Routing Add-on (Managed NGINX) 26년11월까지 지원종료 예정을 확인되어 App Routing Gateway API 전환을 준비중에 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">아래와 같이 ingress 내 annotation을 적용 운영중에 있습니다. Gateway API 설정 시 아래의 annotation 설정이 가능한 영역인건지, 가이드 기술지원 요청 드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; annotations:</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/affinity: cookie</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-size:</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/session-cookie-name: route</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-ciphers:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-protocols:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">[확인&nbsp;사항]</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">문의주신 ingress-nginx 에서&nbsp;사용되던 annotations 들은&nbsp;현재 app routing gateway api에서는&nbsp;사용이&nbsp;불가한&nbsp;상황입니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">기본적&#51004;로&nbsp;아래와&nbsp;같은 crd들만&nbsp;제공되고&nbsp;있&#51004;며</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">```</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">gateways.gateway.networking.k8s.io&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">grpcroutes.gateway.networking.k8s.io&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">httproutes.gateway.networking.k8s.io&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2025-08-29T17:52:37Z</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">referencegrants.gateway.networking.k8s.io&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2025-08-29T17:52:37Z</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">```</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><a data-href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/managed-gateway-api#verify-managed-gateway-api-crd-installation\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_b5efb61e-d15d-447a-8c09-1701a8671e54\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/managed-gateway-api#verify-managed-gateway-api-crd-installation\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:rgb(22,63,199); margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/managed-gateway-api#verify-managed-gateway-api-crd-installation</span></a></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">실제&nbsp;공유해주신 annotation에&nbsp;부합되는&nbsp;설정을&nbsp;위해서는 envoyfilter나&nbsp;DestinationRule&nbsp;같은 crd가&nbsp;필요하여&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">이로&nbsp;인해 annotation이&nbsp;매칭되는&nbsp;기능을&nbsp;사용할수는&nbsp;없는&nbsp;상황입니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">다만, 마지막&#51004;로&nbsp;추가해주신 ssl-redirect의&nbsp;경우는&nbsp;아래&nbsp;소개된 httproute 에 requestredirect filter type을&nbsp;통해&nbsp;구현이&nbsp;가능해보입니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><a data-href=\"https://gateway-api.sigs.k8s.io/guides/user-guides/http-redirect-rewrite/#redirects\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_528c57dd-ee77-46f7-81f8-7e55d1b443d7\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://gateway-api.sigs.k8s.io/guides/user-guides/http-redirect-rewrite/#redirects\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:rgb(22,63,199); margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">https://gateway-api.sigs.k8s.io/guides/user-guides/http-redirect-rewrite/#redirects</span></a></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">추가 문의사항이 있&#51004;시면&nbsp;언제든지 저에게 알려주시고,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">회신시에는 반드시 &quot;전체 회신&quot; &#51004;로 해 주시기를 요청 드립니다. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(0,113,194)\">백도운, Doun Baek</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(0,113,194)\">Azure Containers&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">| Support Escalation Engineer</span><br><span style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:10pt\">Microsoft Korea | Office: +82 (2) 531-8172 | E-mail:&nbsp;</span><a data-href=\"mailto:jacobbaek@microsoft.com\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_377385a7-169e-4f5a-886d-884151ff33c6\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:jacobbaek@microsoft.com\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:rgb(5,99,193)\"><span style=\"font-